*.zip

# PM STAGE A REVIEW R5 repair: blind key/mapping/seed artifacts are
# PM-review-only evidence -- NEVER committed, so the repository itself can
# never be used to unblind an owner-listening pack. The seed itself is
# supplied at runtime via a required env var (AUTOMIX_R3_BLIND_SEED,
# see scripts/build_listening_pack.py) and is never hardcoded in source.
results/blind_key.json
results/.blind_seed_local
premix_diag/

